    "body": "## Summary\n\n- carry the signed access-token expiry into the server-side STOMP session binding and fail closed for expired inbound and outbound traffic\n- publish access-token rotation from the in-memory web auth client, refresh shortly before expiry, and reconnect STOMP with the replacement Bearer while restoring subscriptions\n- cover JWT expiry propagation, session expiry, outbound/inbound denial, token notifications, and realtime reconnection; document the resulting lifecycle\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test` (15/15)\n- `npm run lint`\n- `npm run build`\n- `npm audit --omit=dev --audit-level=high` (0 vulnerabilities)\n- `git diff --check`\n\nThe full Java 21 Maven, container/runtime, CodeQL, and ledger suites are delegated to the repository workflows on this exact head.",
